('SEC01','Ferry departures and shore choice',0,[-2,2,54,43],['M01','M02','M03','S1','S2','R6'],[P('L','leader',[10,32,0],[6.5,45,0]),P('F','follower',[13,25,0],[10,32,0]),P('O','opponent',[46,30,0],[27,27,0]),P('S','support',[37,26,0],[54,25,0])],'Ferry exits divide before Laundry undercroft and Cooper rise; shore remains a separate ground commitment. A sighting at Cooper does not identify the whole attack. Buildings, not a spawn screen, form departures.','Follower can keep the near return or move toward Cooper. The long shore is not a free late rotation; its usefulness is conditional on remaining time.',['R01','R02','R03']),
('SEC02','Laundry lower / upper transfer',4,[4,35,36,65],['M04','I01','I02','I03','D01','D02','D03','D04','S1a','S1b','H-L'],[P('L','leader',[22,44.5,4],[26,44.5,4]),P('F','follower',[22,49,3],[22,46,4]),P('O','opponent',[30,48,4],[27,46,4]),P('S','support',[17,59.5,4],[17,58,4])],'The lower undercroft is roofed at 3.7 m and feeds an internal returning stair. Upper exit D03 reaches Press frontage; D04 reaches the civic street through a 3 m-deep gallery. The stair hole stays open over both flights and its +2 landing.','The narrow east gallery separates the follower from an immediate north-door trade. A player can withdraw down the stair, but the lower entry is another potential opponent front. The upper floor is not a scenic roof.',['R01','R07']),
